  '<h3 class="gd-h3">Where things are</h3><div class="gd-tablewrap"><table class="gd-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">What it is for</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">To do</b></td><td>Next up, your lanes with their timers, then every open task</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Today at a glance</b></td><td>Pickups, returns, what is due</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Working as</b></td><td>Switch function (above the menu)</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Customer service</b></td><td>Requests, New quote, Renter messages, Owner forms</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Finance</b></td><td>Payments, Tolls and tickets, Reconciliation, Turo trips</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Fleet</b></td><td>Field jobs, Field hours, Daily checks, Photo reviews, Listings, Similar cars</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Sales</b></td><td>Requests and offers, New quote, Add a rental, Buyer leads; owners on My sales</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">Add a rental, New quote</b></td><td>Every function</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">My sales</b></td><td>Your commissions, quotes, offers, bookings and booked revenue</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">My scorecard</b></td><td>Your results by week</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 class="gd-h3">Top tasks</h3><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Take a task:</em> <b class="gd-ui">My work</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">To do</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Take it</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Done</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Send an offer:</em> <b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Requests</b>, the booking, then <b class="gd-ui">Send the offer</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Quote a caller:</em> <b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">New quote</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Create the request</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t"><em>See your sales:</em> <b class="gd-ui">My work</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">My sales</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">By week</b> or <b class="gd-ui">By month</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Claim a client you found:</em> <b class="gd-ui">I sourced this client</b> when you add the rental or send the offer</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Review Forms C and D:</em> <b class="gd-ui">Owner forms</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Approve</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Read a toll notice:</em> <b class="gd-ui">Tolls and tickets</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Read a notice</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">8</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Issue a refund:</em> <b class="gd-ui">Request the refund</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Issue the refund</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">9</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Schedule a field job:</em> <b class="gd-ui">Field jobs</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Schedule</b></div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">10</span><div class="gd-t"><em>Cover a plate:</em> <b class="gd-ui">Cover the plate</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Save the covered photo</b></div></li></ol></div><h3 class="gd-h3">If something goes wrong</h3><div class="gd-tablewrap"><table class="gd-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">What you see</th><th scope="col">What to do</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">A link says it expired</b></td><td>Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press <b class="gd-ui">Send me a new link</b> on that page.</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">&quot;Error 1102&quot; on a page</b></td><td>A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in.</td></tr><tr><td><b class="gd-ui">&quot;That email and password do not match an account.&quot;</b></td><td>Check the address, or use <b class=